# Phase 1: Project Foundation & Scaffolding

## Goal
Set up the complete project foundation so subsequent phases only add features, never fight infrastructure.

## Step-by-Step Build Order

### 1. Create Next.js Project
```bash
npx create-next-app@latest . --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app --src-dir --import-alias "@/*"
```
- Use Tailwind CSS v4
- TypeScript strict mode in `tsconfig.json`

### 2. Install Dependencies
```bash
# Core
npm install convex @clerk/nextjs @clerk/clerk-react

# UI
npx shadcn@latest init
npx shadcn@latest add button input card dialog table form select tabs badge dropdown-menu sheet tooltip calendar popover command separator skeleton textarea label switch checkbox radio-group avatar scroll-area

# Forms & Validation
npm install react-hook-form @hookform/resolvers zod

# Tables
npm install @tanstack/react-table

# Calendar (admin)
npm install @fullcalendar/react @fullcalendar/daygrid @fullcalendar/timegrid @fullcalendar/interaction

# PDF & Email (Phase 4-5 but install now)
npm install pdf-lib resend @react-email/components

# State (ephemeral UI only)
npm install zustand

# Utilities
npm install date-fns lucide-react
```

### 3. Set Up Convex
```bash
npx convex dev
```
Define the FULL schema in `convex/schema.ts` — all Phase 1 tables from @docs/SPEC.md section 5. Include all indexes.

### 4. Set Up Clerk
- Create `.env.local` with Clerk keys and Convex URL
- Configure `ClerkProvider` in root layout
- Set up `ConvexProviderWithClerk` for Convex+Clerk integration
- Create proxy.ts protecting `/admin/*` and `/portal/*` (Next.js 16 uses `proxy` instead of `middleware`)

### 5. Create Admin Layout Shell
- Sidebar with navigation links (Calendars, Contacts, Ads, Purchases, Billing, Events, Layouts, Dashboard)
- Header with Clerk `UserButton` and org name
- Main content area with `{children}`
- Mobile-responsive: sidebar collapses to Sheet on small screens

### 6. Create Shared Utilities
- `src/lib/types.ts` — TypeScript types mirroring Convex schema
- `src/lib/validators.ts` — Zod schemas for all forms
- `src/lib/utils.ts` — cn() helper (from shadcn), date formatters, currency formatters
- `src/lib/file-storage.ts` — `useFileUrl()` / `getFileUrl()` abstraction
- `src/hooks/use-org.ts` — hook to get current Clerk orgId

### 7. Create Reusable Components
- `src/components/shared/data-table.tsx` — TanStack Table wrapper
- `src/components/shared/page-header.tsx` — consistent page headers
- `src/components/shared/confirm-dialog.tsx` — reusable confirmation modal
- `src/components/shared/empty-state.tsx` — empty list states
- `src/components/shared/table-skeleton.tsx` — loading skeleton for tables

## Environment Variables Template
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=
CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT=
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_IN_URL=/auth/login
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_UP_URL=/auth/register
```

## Validation Checklist
- [ ] `npm run dev` starts without errors
- [ ] `npx convex dev` connects and schema deploys
- [ ] Visiting `/admin` redirects to `/auth/login` when logged out
- [ ] Visiting `/admin` shows sidebar layout when logged in
- [ ] shadcn components render correctly
- [ ] TypeScript strict mode passes with no errors
